  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping Help Guide\n\n### Schedule - Minutes of Meeting Notes\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 23 Aug, 2021 at  1:14 PM\n\n\t\tLocation:  Bookkeeping module > Dashboard > Client specific > Schedule > Minutes of Meeting\n\nHelp/Guide  \n\nMinutes of the meeting is a written or recorded documentation to inform attendees and non-attendees of the happenings during the meeting.\n\nOn clicking +Add page appears for new.\n\nMinutes Include;\n\nWriters Meeting\n\nMeeting called to order at......by.......\n\nMeeting Location\n\nMeeting Type\n\nMembers Present\n\nReading of Agenda\n\nApproval of Minutes\n\nBusiness\n\nMeeting adjourned at\n\nSchedule Notes\n\nYou can add a note by +Note\n\nYou need to enter title and description.\n\nSame would be listed on note page, You can also filter by title and description, and search the note.\n\nFor each note, you can select action as Edit Delete.\n\n### Adding Schedule notes\n\n### \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
