of Minutes</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Business</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Meeting adjourned at</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Schedule Notes</span></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You can add a note by +Note</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You need to enter title and description.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Same would be listed on note page, You can also filter by title and description, and search the note.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">For each note, you can select action as Edit Delete.</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Adding Schedule notes</span></h4><p><br></p><h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9073936551/original/esFQQFV38clD-mTeWxeNFk3GQSH-cyCzuQ.png?1553187541\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9073936551/original/esFQQFV38clD-mTeWxeNFk3GQSH-cyCzuQ.png?1553187541\" data-fileid=\"9073936551\" data-uniquekey=\"1553187517915\" style=\"width: 1062px;\"></span></h4><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165232\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165232/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\